<title>LUXEMBOURG: Cargolux air cargo up 4pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Cargolux air cargo up 4pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargolux Airlines International said it flew 2.02 billion freight tonne kilometres (FTK) in 1996, up four percent on the previous year.</p>
<p>Cargolux operates a fleet of three 747-400F's and is to take delivery of a futher two 400Fs later this year.</p>
<p>The Luxembourg-based cargo airline also operates four 747-200F's, including one on leaseback. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
